I'd really like to know: is the above sketch correct, in its logic and syntax?
The basic authentication and the session management is appropriate (expiration, is_my_user_authenticated and the expires parameters in the cookie)?
The logging is done in the right way?
I missed something important?
How to deploy? I used plackup for testing purpose. I see <C>debug</C> infos in logs: why they are there (happy to see them atm..)? 
What strings like <C>[MfmL-Zeg]</C> means in loglines?<P>

Thanks for reading<P>


L*<P>

